    ('hit_expertise_walkback', 'Crit table and hit table are INDEPENDENT rolls - Holystrike critting on spell table does not mean it rolls spell hit. Only ~5.4% of the Paladin v5 parse damage is confirmed spell-hit-gated (Holy Shock+Judgement). Melee-table hybrid abilities use melee hit (already capped). Periodic effects cannot miss. Procs riding an already-landed attack do not re-roll. Summoned procs (Hammer from the Heavens, JotTH, ~29% of damage) are UNRESOLVED whether they roll a hit check at all - decides whether raid Hit weight is ~0.0 or ~1.2.', 'Handoff', '§10'),
