    ('method_crit_table_id', 'Cheapest mechanics test available: parse crit% per source, sort against the sheet\'s melee and spell crit values in one combat log - immediately reveals which table each ability uses; 0% crit reveals a periodic effect. Settled the Holystrike crit-table question after 2 doc versions "under review". CORRECTION (v7): a nonzero crit% on a periodic/ground effect is NOT reliable evidence it differs structurally from a normal aura tick - Molten Earth is a confirmed aura-tick DoT that still crits. Use crit% to sort spell-vs-melee table, not to infer implementation.', 'Primer', '§5'),
