    ('rank_mechanics', 'A card guarantees the MAX RANK of a talent (that\'s the reason to slot one) - X/Y shown is the ROLL result, not spent points, and there is no respec lever. Rolling an upgrade on a held partial-rank card refunds the reroll if it hits; partial-rank talents reportedly have a higher chance of rolling their own upgrade. A 1/1 single-rank card is a cheaper acquisition than chasing a 5-rank card to max.', 'Primer', '§2'),
