    ('class_tag_proof_case_2', 'Molten Earth is triggered by Lava Lash (Shaman) but its own tooltip confirms "uses Fire Nova modifiers" - a DIFFERENT modifier bucket. Elemental Fusion and Lava Flows buff Lava Lash directly but do NOT buff Molten Earth, despite the trigger relationship. A recommendation assuming otherwise was made and retracted same-session. Corollary: never assume a spawned/triggered secondary effect inherits its trigger\'s modifier bucket by proximity - check its own "uses X modifiers" line independently. Second proof case for the class-tag rule alongside Lightbound Cleave/Cleave.', 'Primer', '§4 (v7)'),
